            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ujanye ku rugabano rwa Yuda, uhereye i burasirazuba ugashitsa i burengerazuba hazoba wa mugabane w’ishikanwa muzoshikana; ubgaguke bgawo buzoba amatambge ibihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, n’uburebure bgawo buzongana n’iyindi migabane, uhereye i burasirazuba ugashitsa burengerazuba: kand’ ahēra hazoja hagati muri ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo mugabane muzoshikanira Uhoraho, uburebure bgawo buzoba amatambge ibihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu, n’ubgaguke ibihumbi cumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.45.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 45:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ uwo mugabane wera uzoba uw’ abaherezi; uruhande rwawo rurābana n’i burārūko, uburebure bgarwo buzoba amatambge y’ukuboko nyene ibihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu, n’aharābana n’i burengerazuba ubgaguke buzoba amatambge ibihumbi cumi, n’aharābana n’i burasirazuba ubgaguke buzoba ibihumbi cumi nyene, n’aharābana n’i bumanuko uburebure bgaho buzoba ibihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu: maz’ ahēra h’Uhoraho hazoja hagati muri ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
