              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalewi na bo bazogira umugabane ugendanye ku rugabano rw’abaherezi, uburebure bgawo buzoba amatambge ibihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, n’ubgaguke ibihumbi cumi; uburebure bgose buzoba amatambge ibihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu, n’ubgaguke ibihumbi cumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
