            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ntibaze bagire aho bagura kuri wo, canke ngo bahakābe, kand’ uwo mugabane mwiza w’igihugu ntuz’ uhabge abandi, kukw ar’ uwera, urobanuriwe Uhoraho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
