            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikirēre c’amatambge ibihumbi bitanu casigaye ku bgaguke bgaho, kibangikanye na vya bihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu, kizoba ic’ abantu, aho kwubakwa igisagara, habe aho kuba hakikujwe n’imparure, igisagara kibe hagati muri yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izi ni zo ngero zaco: uruhande rw’i burārūko ruzoba amatambge ibihumbi bine n’amajana atanu y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, uruhande rw’i bumanuko ibihumbi bine n’amajana atanu, uruhande rw’i burasirazuba ibihumbi bine n’amajana atanu, n’ uruhande rw’i burengerazuba ibihumbi bine n’amajana atanu nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ico gisagara kize kigire imparure: aharābana n’i burārūko habe amatambge amajana abiri na mirongwitanu, aharābana n’i bumanuko amajana abiri na mirongwitanu, n’aharābana n’i burasirazuba amajana abiri na mirongwitanu, n’aharābana n’i burengerazuba amajana abiri na mirongwitanu nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ahasigaye hahereranye n’uburebure bg’umugabane wera w’ishikanwa, uruhande rwaho rurābana n’i burasirazuba ruzoba amatambge ibihumbi cumi y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, n’uruhande rwaho rurābana n’i burengerazuba ruzoba ibihumbi cumi nyene: hazoba hahereranye n’umugabane wera w’ishikanwa; kand’ ibiharimwa bizoba ivyo gutunga abakora mu gisagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababa mu gisagara bo mu miryango yose y’ Abisirayeli, ni bo bazoharima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 21:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umugabane w’ishikanwa wose na wose uzoba amakika ibihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu n’uburebure ibihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu nyene: umugabane wera w’ishikanwa muze muwushikane ungana impande zose ukw ari zine, hakora n’ishamvu y’igisagara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
