              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 45:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasigaye ho mu mpande zompi z’umugabane wera w’ishikanwa bo n’ishamvu y’igisagara, haze habe aha segaba; ahahereranye na vya bihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu vyo ku rubibe rw’ umugabane wera w’ishikanwa rwerekeye i burasirazuba, n’ahahereranye na vya bihumbi mirongwibiri na bitanu vyo ku rubibe rwerekeye i burengerazuba, hajanye kur’ iyo migabane yindi, hazoba aha segaba. Nuk’ uwo mugabane wera w’ishikanwa bo n’ahēra h’ingoro, bizoca hagati y’aha segaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ uhereye kw ishamvu y’Abalewi ugashitsa kw ishamvu y’igisagara, ari ho nyene haciye hagati y’aha segaba, kuva ku rugabano rwa Yuda ugashitsa ku rugabano rwa Benyamini, hazoba aha segaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.22"
            ]
          }
        }
