          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya ni yo azoba amarembo y’ igisagara; ku ruhande rw’i burārūko uburebure buzoba amatambge ibihumbi bine n’amajana atanu y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
